# Retail validation runs live in-repo so their small, reviewable evidence is
# durable.  Game copies, Wine prefixes, mutated archives, screenshots, and
# other proprietary/runtime artifacts remain ignored.
retail_validation/**
!retail_validation/**/
!retail_validation/**/result.json
!retail_validation/**/report.json
!retail_validation/README.md
